invariant: INV-55
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: a KeyUpdate this side sends leaves the answer owed, so every
  later write sends one more KeyUpdate and rekeys once more, where one
  answer serves the requests read before it. bin/unit requires the
  second write after a run of requests to send its data record alone.

--- old
    t->send_epochs++;
    t->key_update_owed = 0;
--- new
    t->send_epochs++;
